Package: abrain
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-venv, python3-pip, libgl1
Description: Mind map and brain-dump tool
 ABrain is an interactive mind-mapping and note-taking application
 built on PyWebView and Qt6, with KDE Plasma integration.
 .
 Features: multi-map projects with cross-linking, todo lists with
 recurrence, Jira and Google Calendar integration, node metadata
 (status, priority, due dates, tags, attachments, notes).
